<h2>What happens if you block cookies under the cookie policy</h2>
<p>The cookie policy warns that you may not be able to stay logged in, may not be able to complete ticket purchases or see correct pricing and availability, and may see less relevant recommendations. Blocking strictly necessary cookies can significantly affect how the services work.</p>

<h2>Related reading about our cookie policy</h2>
<p>Information collected with cookies can be personal information, so it is also covered by our <a href="/privacy-policy">privacy policy</a>. Use of the platform is governed by our <a href="/terms-and-conditions">terms and conditions</a>. For outside background, Wikipedia explains <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/HTTP_cookie" target="_blank" rel="noopener">HTTP cookies</a>, and the FTC describes <a href="https://consumer.ftc.gov/articles/how-websites-and-apps-collect-and-use-your-information" target="_blank" rel="noopener">how websites and apps collect and use your information</a>.</p>

